WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.276
Orion, seen from the side.

00:02.976 --> 00:04.456
Now leave home.

00:04.906 --> 00:09.886
Bellatrix, the hunter's shoulder, is two hundred and fifty light-years from us.

00:10.336 --> 00:15.715
Betelgeuse is five hundred, and the middle star of the belt nearly two thousand.

00:16.165 --> 00:23.509
The hunter is a line of sight, not a place: from here, hundreds of light-years to one side, nobody would draw him.
